miniace-Outpace engine image
====================

This image contains outpace, an independent implementation of the public
AceStream live path.

  Project:  https://github.com/jamezrin/outpace-stream
  Author:   https://github.com/jamezrin
  Version:  v0.5.0
  Licence:  AGPL-3.0-or-later
  Source:   https://github.com/jamezrin/outpace-stream/tree/v0.5.0

The outpace binary is unmodified and is copied from the official multi-arch
image pinned in the Dockerfile. The licence text is installed at
/usr/share/doc/outpace/LICENSE.

miniace-Outpace's own scripts in /opt/miniace-outpace are licensed under
AGPL-3.0-or-later; see the project repository for details.
